WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:03.378
We beg you!

00:03.920 --> 00:06.464
Please keep her in this house!

00:07.424 --> 00:09.175
Put her in your house.

00:09.259 --> 00:10.427
That's impossible!

00:10.510 --> 00:13.430
I can only think of the Ayase residence
that can take in someone like this!

00:13.513 --> 00:15.682
We already got a cat, so why not?

00:15.765 --> 00:18.143
Don't lump me together
with a nobody like that!

00:18.226 --> 00:20.270
That thing doesn't even eat!

00:20.854 --> 00:23.982
So what happened to the male one anyway?

00:24.065 --> 00:25.942
It went back to the chemistry room.

00:26.025 --> 00:26.985
Huh?

00:27.694 --> 00:31.823
"I can stay an anatomical model without
worries as long as Hana is okay," he said.

00:31.906 --> 00:35.452
But in return, he's gonna
sneak outta school at night

00:35.535 --> 00:37.620
and he'd like to see Hana then.

00:37.704 --> 00:40.457
We have to rely on
your magnanimous heart, Auntie!

00:40.540 --> 00:41.833
Please!

00:41.916 --> 00:43.251
Please!

00:44.586 --> 00:47.756
Sheesh. Anatomical models
getting in heat, huh?

00:48.381 --> 00:51.384
Just be lovey-dovey without
bothering the neighbors.

00:51.468 --> 00:53.762
Anyway, what about the ball?

00:53.845 --> 00:55.638
Oh, about that...

00:55.722 --> 00:58.683
It was just a Christmas ornament.

00:58.767 --> 01:00.060
Crazy.

01:00.143 --> 01:03.897
Kinda like when animals make
their butts glow when they're courting?

01:03.980 --> 01:05.440
Then it can't be helped.

01:05.523 --> 01:07.734
No, I'm not convinced at all.

01:07.817 --> 01:10.195
We're gonna eat, so pull the table out.

01:10.278 --> 01:11.946
Okarun, you'll eat too, right?

01:12.030 --> 01:13.990
Oh, sure. I'd love to.

01:16.868 --> 01:18.036
Man, what a pain.

01:18.119 --> 01:20.789
Momo, you have some amazing powers, huh?

01:21.289 --> 01:24.542
I understand why Auntie
trusted you to do the exorcism!

01:24.626 --> 01:27.337
And Okarun, too!
That transformation was wicked!

01:27.420 --> 01:29.380
It was so badass!

01:29.464 --> 01:32.133
I wish I had some kind of power, too.

01:32.217 --> 01:34.135
Oh, well, um...

01:34.219 --> 01:36.513
I'm getting the table out
so can you guys move?

01:36.596 --> 01:38.389
Oh, let me help!

01:39.015 --> 01:41.392
Thanks. Hold that end.

01:41.476 --> 01:43.394
Roger that!

01:44.938 --> 01:47.899
Come on! You're just getting in my way!

01:48.441 --> 01:50.276
Oh, Momo, hold on.

01:53.738 --> 01:54.989
Got some lint.

01:56.991 --> 01:58.952
Yeah. Thanks.

01:59.035 --> 02:01.287
Gimme more thanks, yeah?

02:01.371 --> 02:02.831
Just move, please.

02:02.914 --> 02:04.749
I'll get outta the way after one more.

02:04.833 --> 02:06.042
Then I'll never say it.

02:09.003 --> 02:12.841
You're the one I fell in love with.
I won't let go of you no matter what!

02:12.924 --> 02:17.345
If I don't do anything right here and now,
I'll regret it for the rest of my life!

02:18.054 --> 02:19.806
Miss Ayase!

02:20.598 --> 02:22.767
There's lint!

02:25.562 --> 02:27.313
Got it. Sorry about that.

02:28.022 --> 02:29.149
Thanks.

02:29.232 --> 02:30.191
And what's wrong?

02:30.859 --> 02:33.528
I decided that I'm not going to hold back.

02:33.611 --> 02:36.322
I decided that
I'm going to fight adamantly.

02:36.406 --> 02:37.407
Against what?

02:54.757 --> 02:56.676
Hey, morons. You're in the way.

02:56.759 --> 02:58.136
Settle down!

02:58.219 --> 02:59.637
You'll kick up dust all over the place!

02:59.721 --> 03:01.014
Sorry, ma'am!

03:01.097 --> 03:03.933
And Momo, you're gonna stay over
at Jiji's place this weekend

03:04.017 --> 03:05.727
so you better have your
underwear and stuff ready.

03:05.810 --> 03:08.271
Hey! Why would you say stuff like that?

03:08.354 --> 03:11.274
Miss Ayase? At Mr. Jiji's house? Why?!

03:11.357 --> 03:14.444
What? I didn't tell you?

03:14.527 --> 03:18.281
Jiji's house is cursed
and he wants it exorcised.

03:18.364 --> 03:20.450
That's why he came to our place.

03:24.037 --> 03:27.582
Miss Ayase, were you going
to go there all alone with Mr. Jiji?!

03:27.665 --> 03:28.875
Of course not.

03:28.958 --> 03:31.169
I was planning on asking you
to come along, Okarun.

03:31.252 --> 03:33.463
I'd feel a bit uneasy doing it by myself.

03:33.546 --> 03:35.882
Then let's hurry up and get it done!

03:35.965 --> 03:39.636
Let's resolve it quickly and have
Mr. Jiji hurry on home!

03:39.719 --> 03:41.512
Thank you! Woo!

03:41.596 --> 03:42.931
What? What now?

03:47.727 --> 03:50.897
Crap! School at night is super scary!

03:50.980 --> 03:52.815
Isn't it bad to go in without permission?

03:52.899 --> 03:56.069
It's fine. We're just gonna
play with a Ouija board.

03:56.152 --> 03:57.612
I'll film it on video.

03:57.695 --> 04:00.782
Huh? Hold on, do you hear something?

04:00.865 --> 04:03.409
Come on, stop that.

04:06.621 --> 04:09.165
- No way. For real?
- What? No, scary!

04:13.002 --> 04:15.630
You're in the way! Step aside!

04:26.933 --> 04:28.643
KAMIGOE CITY STATION

04:28.726 --> 04:30.561
Wait for me, Hana!

04:30.645 --> 04:32.772
I'm coming to see you right now!

04:32.855 --> 04:34.774
Hana!

04:50.206 --> 04:51.958
He's not here yet.

04:54.502 --> 04:56.921
And it's four o'clock already.

05:04.971 --> 05:09.559
It's fine. I'll wait here
with you until he shows up.

05:10.184 --> 05:12.478
I'm sure he'll come.

05:14.647 --> 05:16.065
It'll be okay.

05:42.592 --> 05:45.011
Sorry for being late, Hana.

05:45.970 --> 05:47.055
Taro.

05:48.056 --> 05:49.348
I love you.

06:16.084 --> 06:18.044
Crap. I fell asleep.

06:18.127 --> 06:19.504
What? Hey!

06:19.587 --> 06:21.672
If you're here, you should wake me up!

06:22.173 --> 06:24.675
Thank you so much, Miss Momo!

06:24.759 --> 06:27.804
You were waiting with her!

06:27.887 --> 06:29.847
I had a lot happen tonight,
but starting tomorrow,

06:29.931 --> 06:31.682
I will make sure to come on time.

06:31.766 --> 06:33.309
You're gonna come every day?

06:33.851 --> 06:37.105
KEEP OUT
JIJI'S ROOM

06:45.363 --> 06:49.117
Damn it, I can't sleep tonight either.

06:55.206 --> 06:56.916
Because of him.

08:29.258 --> 08:32.887
I'll pretend to take this,
and then take this one!

08:33.721 --> 08:36.599
Okarun, you really suck
at playing Old Maid!

08:36.682 --> 08:39.393
You guys just have demented personalities!

08:39.477 --> 08:41.437
Maybe you're naïve? Yeah, naïve!

08:41.521 --> 08:43.272
A naïve Okarun? Priceless!

08:43.356 --> 08:44.482
I won't play anymore!

08:45.066 --> 08:47.944
Sheesh, that was just a joke.
We're kidding!

08:48.027 --> 08:51.197
Okarun! I'll give you some candy!
So cheer up!

08:52.114 --> 08:55.284
Wow, these are so nostalgic. I love these!

08:55.368 --> 08:58.204
I bought a ton so you should
eat some too, Momo!

08:58.788 --> 09:02.333
By the way, I was really impressed that
the candy shop over there still exists!

09:02.416 --> 09:05.002
That grandma running the shop
never changes!

09:05.086 --> 09:09.006
She still did the, "Here you go.
Your change is 500,000 yen," bit.

09:09.090 --> 09:12.552
I was so touched like Creamy Mami, woo!

09:12.635 --> 09:15.221
I hate having thoughts like this.

09:16.931 --> 09:19.684
I get fed up with my own shortcomings.

09:20.476 --> 09:23.521
But I can't do anything
about this feeling.

09:24.146 --> 09:26.649
I have to take my mind off of it somehow.

09:26.732 --> 09:29.694
I have to concentrate
on getting my nut back!

09:31.195 --> 09:34.657
Nut... Nut...

09:35.157 --> 09:36.367
Nut...

09:36.450 --> 09:38.452
Nut...

09:38.536 --> 09:41.038
Nut...

09:41.122 --> 09:41.872
Okarun, what's wrong?

09:41.956 --> 09:42.707
My nut!

09:44.333 --> 09:46.877
Okarun, you're thinking about
your nut too much.

09:46.961 --> 09:48.671
No, that's not it! This is...

09:48.754 --> 09:51.257
Hey, I've been wondering for a while now.

09:51.340 --> 09:53.509
Since when have dirty jokes
been the new thing?

09:53.593 --> 09:56.971
Oh no, that's not it.
There's a story behind it.

09:57.054 --> 09:59.390
Then I'll make something else get popular.

09:59.473 --> 10:00.808
Hip joint!

10:00.891 --> 10:03.144
No. Dirty jokes are not in.

10:03.227 --> 10:04.478
Vamo lá!

10:04.562 --> 10:06.230
That's Kazu's thing.

10:06.314 --> 10:08.941
Pathetic! You're so pathetic, Ken!

10:09.609 --> 10:12.653
But at this rate, my own heart won't last!

10:13.446 --> 10:16.616
I must take the initiative
in grasping Miss Ayase's interests.

10:19.660 --> 10:22.872
I will now talk about tsuchinokos!

10:23.372 --> 10:24.999
Whoa now!

10:25.082 --> 10:26.751
Tsuchinoko? I wanna hear!

10:26.834 --> 10:29.670
UMAs are not creatures of fantasy!

10:29.754 --> 10:33.257
Actually, even gorillas were UMAs
until about a hundred years ago!

10:33.341 --> 10:35.343
And I believe that a tsuchinoko

10:35.426 --> 10:37.970
will be the next UMA
to follow in the footsteps of gorillas!

10:38.054 --> 10:41.766
Oh yeah, our village has
a legend of a great serpent.

10:41.849 --> 10:45.603
A shrine that's said to have 200 years
of history and worships a great snake.

10:45.686 --> 10:47.897
It's called Tsuchinoko Shrine!

10:47.980 --> 10:49.065
Wow!

10:49.565 --> 10:52.818
Let's go to that shrine! I want to see
a giant tsuchinoko snake!

10:52.902 --> 10:56.447
Sheesh, you're so hopeless.
Stay close to me at all times, okay?

10:56.530 --> 10:58.199
Crap! The initiative!

10:58.282 --> 11:00.242
A mummified kappa!

11:00.326 --> 11:02.662
There's a shrine that worships that, too.

11:02.745 --> 11:05.790
So shrines that worship UMAs
are not that uncommon.

11:06.624 --> 11:09.669
How's that? I'll toss that UMA
shrine legend right back at ya!

11:09.752 --> 11:12.505
Seriously? Isn't that totally wicked?

11:12.588 --> 11:14.673
That means kappas exist!

11:14.757 --> 11:16.675
Wait, hold on, then what about Nessie?

11:16.759 --> 11:18.302
They have a photo and everything!

11:18.386 --> 11:20.179
I personally think they exist!
I want to see them!

11:20.262 --> 11:22.598
The photograph of Nessie
is called the Surgeon's Photograph.

11:22.681 --> 11:24.433
They have since determined it
to be a fake,

11:24.517 --> 11:26.519
but I saw one recently with my own eyes!

11:26.602 --> 11:28.771
Seriously? I wanna see one, too!

11:28.854 --> 11:31.023
Huh? Come to think, this is the first time

11:31.107 --> 11:34.026
that I've talked this much to someone
other than Miss Ayase.

11:34.652 --> 11:36.070
- This is fun!
- This is fun!

11:36.153 --> 11:38.989
Okarun, you're amazing!
You know everything!

11:39.073 --> 11:41.117
I totally respect you as a friend!

11:42.701 --> 11:44.412
F-Friend.

11:44.495 --> 11:45.830
Huh? We're not?

11:45.913 --> 11:47.998
I'm totally shocked and absorbed.

11:48.082 --> 11:50.000
You're one of Momo's friends, right?

11:50.084 --> 11:52.920
Then can you make me
one of your friends, too?

11:54.547 --> 11:57.216
Sorry, I am an awkward fellow after all.

11:58.008 --> 12:00.010
I told you to not say that!

12:00.094 --> 12:01.887
Huh? What's up? Why?

12:01.971 --> 12:03.806
You don't have to know, Jiji!

12:03.889 --> 12:06.725
Even Momo is leaving me out
of the loop, too!

12:06.809 --> 12:09.603
Why isn't he more despicable?

12:09.687 --> 12:13.107
If he's such a good guy, then I...

12:19.405 --> 12:21.490
Hey!

12:21.574 --> 12:23.868
This is a hot springs district!

12:23.951 --> 12:26.328
It's in relation to my dad's work...

12:26.412 --> 12:28.789
Wasn't your dad a teacher or something?

12:29.373 --> 12:32.418
He's doing research on volcanoes
at a nearby college.

12:32.501 --> 12:35.463
And that's why we all moved here, too.

12:35.546 --> 12:38.174
A volcano? Is it okay?
Not gonna erupt or anything?

12:38.799 --> 12:42.887
There are records that it erupted
about 200 years ago.

12:42.970 --> 12:45.097
But it seems to have calmed down since.

12:45.181 --> 12:46.140
I see.

12:48.684 --> 12:51.312
MANJU
HOT SPRINGS MANJU

12:52.396 --> 12:54.064
Slurp-a-durp!

12:54.899 --> 12:55.983
Are we gonna...

12:56.066 --> 12:57.318
I don't wanna hear it.

12:57.401 --> 12:59.111
Hurray!

13:16.879 --> 13:18.380
Slurp-a-durp!

13:20.424 --> 13:22.343
Hurray!

13:34.939 --> 13:36.565
This way now!

13:39.902 --> 13:43.447
How is it, Momo?
Do you see a weird aura or anything?

13:43.989 --> 13:46.784
Just how much stamina do you have?

13:50.246 --> 13:52.831
I don't see anything at all.

13:53.415 --> 13:54.875
Like, it's totally ordinary.

13:54.959 --> 13:56.043
For real?

13:56.126 --> 13:59.255
All the spirit mediums said
it was totally bad news!

13:59.338 --> 14:02.091
More like I want to get
some rest first. I'm thirsty.

14:02.174 --> 14:04.218
Wait, you really can't see anything?

14:04.301 --> 14:05.386
Really? For real?

14:05.469 --> 14:06.929
Really, for real.

14:07.012 --> 14:09.932
H-Hold on, Miss Ayase.

14:11.892 --> 14:13.519
Okarun, hurry on over!

14:13.602 --> 14:14.937
Oh, okay.

14:25.990 --> 14:27.658
How is it, Miss Ayase?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.910
Do you see any weird auras or something?

14:36.876 --> 14:37.543
How is it?

14:37.626 --> 14:39.587
The TV turned on by itself!

14:39.670 --> 14:40.880
That was me.

14:40.963 --> 14:42.756
Oh, that scared me!

14:42.840 --> 14:45.217
Why did you suddenly turn on the TV?

14:45.301 --> 14:47.219
Because I'm bored.

14:47.303 --> 14:49.013
There's nothing here.

14:50.514 --> 14:53.642
And that's it for us! Back to the studio!

14:54.476 --> 14:57.021
Huh? Are you doubting me?

14:57.104 --> 14:58.439
That's not it.

14:58.522 --> 15:02.151
When spirit mediums came by,
they said this place was bad news, right?

15:02.234 --> 15:06.155
This is my prediction, but maybe
those ghosts are hiding right now.

15:06.989 --> 15:09.575
It was like this back
with Turbo Granny, too.

15:09.658 --> 15:12.828
When the spirit's power is weak,
it's hard for me to notice them.

15:12.912 --> 15:15.372
So it's easy for them to go into hiding.

15:15.456 --> 15:16.707
In other words...

15:16.790 --> 15:18.334
This'll be a piece of cake, yeah?

15:18.417 --> 15:19.919
How awesome!

15:20.002 --> 15:22.379
Lady Momo! Allow me
to massage your shoulders!

15:22.463 --> 15:23.380
Hey!

15:25.799 --> 15:27.885
I have no objections.

15:27.968 --> 15:32.431
Oh, I want to drink some juice.
A sweet one!

15:32.514 --> 15:34.558
I will get some ready right away!

15:34.642 --> 15:36.018
Touched... Shoulder...

15:37.686 --> 15:39.313
Let's get some rest for now.

15:40.189 --> 15:41.774
Okarun, you should sit too.

15:46.779 --> 15:52.451
Spirits are gonna show up at night anyway,
so let's rest when we can.

15:55.955 --> 15:56.789
Okay.

15:56.872 --> 15:59.416
And so, I'm gonna head out
into the hot springs district!

15:59.500 --> 16:00.417
Huh?

16:01.001 --> 16:02.544
Did you just say there were no spirits

16:02.628 --> 16:05.005
because you wanted
to go to the hot springs?

16:05.089 --> 16:07.591
That's not true! There really aren't any!

16:08.217 --> 16:10.678
Anyway, please have fun with Jiji, okay?

16:10.761 --> 16:12.805
Huh? You're really gonna go?

16:12.888 --> 16:15.015
What are we gonna do if a spirit shows up?

16:15.099 --> 16:18.477
It's fine! I'll be back by evening!

16:19.061 --> 16:20.479
I'm heading out!

16:20.562 --> 16:21.981
- Hurray!
- Wait, Miss Ayase!

16:22.064 --> 16:23.774
Hurray!

16:23.857 --> 16:26.860
Lady Momo! I have brought you
your sweet juice.

16:26.944 --> 16:27.903
Huh?

16:27.987 --> 16:30.572
Miss Ayase went
to the hot springs district.

16:30.656 --> 16:33.951
Seriously? I wanted to go with her!

16:37.997 --> 16:39.248
Wanna play soccer?

16:42.084 --> 16:43.544
You trap it, then...

16:43.627 --> 16:44.586
Yup, that's it!

16:44.670 --> 16:45.629
You're good!

16:45.713 --> 16:47.673
Now try kicking it my way!

16:47.756 --> 16:51.719
Get your pivot foot next to the ball, and
kick it here with the inside of your foot!

16:52.594 --> 16:54.013
Oh, I'm sorry!

16:54.638 --> 16:56.223
It's okay! Here!

16:57.766 --> 16:59.143
Sorry about that!

16:59.226 --> 17:00.728
I'm so pathetic.

17:00.811 --> 17:03.105
I'm glad Miss Ayase isn't here!

17:03.188 --> 17:05.024
But if I practice here,

17:05.107 --> 17:07.568
I might be able to show Miss Ayase
when the time is right!

17:07.651 --> 17:11.238
Oh, that's amazing, Okarun!
You're so cool!

17:12.656 --> 17:14.366
Hey, Okarun!

17:14.450 --> 17:16.410
Oh, sorry.

17:16.493 --> 17:17.953
You in love with Momo?

17:20.080 --> 17:21.081
Huh?

17:23.834 --> 17:26.754
I hope they're getting along.

17:26.837 --> 17:32.342
It's a first guy friend for Okarun,
so I'm sure I'd just get in the way.

17:32.926 --> 17:35.137
Good for you, Okarun.

17:37.097 --> 17:39.266
I mean, Momo is cute.

17:39.349 --> 17:42.478
- For me, Miss Ayase was my first friend.
- Hey, pass!

17:42.561 --> 17:45.856
I respect her, and she's very dear to me!

17:45.939 --> 17:47.274
Nice pass!

17:47.357 --> 17:52.112
I see, someone dear to you.
Someone you respect.

17:53.405 --> 17:57.201
I really love Momo's face and personality.

17:59.119 --> 18:00.329
I do as well!

18:01.288 --> 18:02.247
Huh?

18:02.831 --> 18:04.208
You just said respect!

18:04.291 --> 18:06.543
It's respect on top of all that!

18:06.627 --> 18:07.961
Isn't that a bit unfair?

18:08.045 --> 18:11.215
Then I'll add how I love
Momo's eyes! There, I win!

18:11.298 --> 18:11.965
Wha--

18:12.049 --> 18:14.468
Then I'll say all that,
plus I love her mouth!

18:14.551 --> 18:15.803
There! I win!

18:15.886 --> 18:17.471
Nope, no good! That's no good!

18:17.554 --> 18:19.139
You can't say "no good"!

18:19.223 --> 18:22.559
I started off by saying I liked her face,
so yours doesn't count!

18:22.643 --> 18:25.187
Then your love of her eyes
won't count either!

18:25.270 --> 18:26.438
It's fine!

18:26.522 --> 18:28.941
I'm Momo's childhood friend!

18:29.024 --> 18:30.400
There, I win!

18:30.484 --> 18:31.777
Grrrr!

18:35.072 --> 18:36.031
Win...

18:36.115 --> 18:37.366
Huh? In what?

18:37.449 --> 18:39.743
You can't just say you win outta nowhere!

18:39.827 --> 18:41.161
This is...

18:41.245 --> 18:42.871
Right, I'm sorry.

18:42.955 --> 18:44.456
What?

18:46.250 --> 18:48.961
I'm starting to feel dizzy.
Time to head out.

18:52.506 --> 18:54.716
It's too bad that it's an open-air bath,

18:54.800 --> 18:58.137
but the walls are too high
to see any scenery.

19:00.973 --> 19:04.309
Oh, we already have someone here.

19:04.893 --> 19:08.480
And she's quite a hottie!

19:12.818 --> 19:13.986
What?!

19:14.570 --> 19:18.073
You're so stubborn!
But I'll admit you've got some guts!

19:18.657 --> 19:21.535
I'm not done yet! I haven't given up!

19:23.787 --> 19:26.415
Hey, let's shake hands as friends!

19:27.666 --> 19:29.710
Oh fine.

19:29.793 --> 19:31.420
I got you now!

19:31.503 --> 19:33.630
Damn you!

19:33.714 --> 19:36.592
Miss Ayase would never be okay
with something this sneaky!

19:36.675 --> 19:38.844
Admit defeat, Okarun!

19:38.927 --> 19:41.763
No way! I'm not gonna give up!

19:41.847 --> 19:43.765
Okarun!

19:44.808 --> 19:47.561
Mr. Jiji, stop! Look at that!

19:51.315 --> 19:52.191
Look at what?

19:52.274 --> 19:53.775
That! Look!

19:55.652 --> 19:57.738
Isn't it a bit strange there?

20:01.992 --> 20:06.163
There wasn't a room
right next to the foyer, was there?

20:07.456 --> 20:11.084
Young lady, you came
to a co-ed bath while being so young?

20:11.627 --> 20:12.461
MALE/FEMALE COMMUNAL USE

20:12.544 --> 20:14.254
There's no way I could read that!

20:14.338 --> 20:15.839
Whew, so hot.

20:15.923 --> 20:17.966
A beer would be nice right now!

20:18.050 --> 20:19.718
Paradise!

20:20.677 --> 20:23.222
I didn't notice at all, but you're right.

20:23.305 --> 20:25.682
It was jutting out
when we looked at it from the outside.

20:25.766 --> 20:28.060
There should be something here.

20:31.188 --> 20:32.356
It's hollow.

20:32.981 --> 20:35.108
Yikes. What should I do?

20:35.192 --> 20:36.818
I want to get out right now,

20:36.902 --> 20:39.404
but those guys are in the way
so it's hard to get out.

20:39.488 --> 20:41.365
Oh no! I have to hurry out of here.

20:41.448 --> 20:43.492
I'm starting to feel lightheaded!

20:44.159 --> 20:45.577
Let's try breaking it down.

20:45.661 --> 20:46.703
Is it all right?

20:46.787 --> 20:50.207
Probably not. We're renting the house,
but we gotta do it, right?

20:50.791 --> 20:53.085
There has to be some reason...

20:53.168 --> 20:55.921
A reason why my parents ended up that way!

20:56.004 --> 20:59.091
Young lady, do you know about gators?

20:59.174 --> 20:59.883
Huh?

20:59.967 --> 21:02.844
Gators? You mean those things
that look like lizards?

21:04.304 --> 21:05.597
Nope, that's not it!

21:05.681 --> 21:12.437
They're guys who often show up
in co-ed baths and target naked women.

21:17.609 --> 21:21.321
Can I deal with all of them
using my psychic powers?

21:30.872 --> 21:35.419
I've heard that a pack of wolves disperse
as soon as you strike their leader.

21:43.051 --> 21:44.511
Crap!
